        Colors for the parts Compose can't draw: the home-screen widget and the app icon.
        Same tokens as ui/theme/PipColors.kt ("Pip — Design Guidelines" → Color); dark values in
        values-night/colors.xml.
    -->
    <color name="paper">#FFF6F3EC</color>

    <!-- App icon: the Paper seed with deep-green lines on a Sprout square, in both themes. -->
